sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	actor User as End user
	participant SP as Service Provider
	participant SAML as /saml/sso
	participant Auth as /api/auth
	participant Login as /login
	participant DB as Local DB

	User->>SP: Open application
	SP->>SAML: HTTP-Redirect or HTTP-POST + SAMLRequest
	Note over SP,SAML: Redirect: deflate+base64 query param<br/>POST: base64 form body<br/>Both support optional encryption
	SAML->>SAML: Validate request · store session
	SAML->>Login: Redirect to login page
	User->>Login: Username + password
	Login->>Auth: POST /api/auth/login
	Auth->>DB: Verify synced password hash
	Auth->>DB: Load groups + roles · bind SamlSession
	Auth->>SAML: Build signed SAMLResponse
	SAML->>SP: HTTP-POST auto-submit form
	SP->>User: Local SP session
